regating to 24.50% stake in LICL, became associate of the company from 30.01.25. 9. 24.01.25 has allotted 26,98,100 employees at an exercise price of Rs. 7.50 each and 5,77,240 at an exercise price of Rs. 9.50. Paid up Capital o increased from 11,622.35 Lakhs to 11,655.10 Lakhs after 31.12.24.  10. 10.10.24 the Co. entered into (“MOU”) with Bhilai Engineering Corporation Limited for acquisition of Engineering Assets of Bhilai Engineering Corporation Limited. 11. 15.10.24, acquired 77 % stake in Techno i.e. 66 % was through 1,76,05,634 on Preferential Allotment in exchange of Techno and 11 %in Cash 12. EPS are not annualised except for the year end. 13. The Orders in hand is Rs. 1,33,416.65 lakhs. 14. The results are available on the website of BSE , NSE  and on company's website at www.lloydsengg.in.The specified items of the standalone financials results are given below: a) Revenue From Operations : (Rs. in Lakhs) For Quarter - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 22,971.59, For 30.09.2024 - 21,214.60, For 31.12.23 - Rs. 20,144.14 For Nine months - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 57,728.59, For 31.12.2023- 43,633.35 For Year - For 31.03.2024 - Rs. 62,423.61 b) ) Profit / Loss before exceptional items and tax : (Rs. in Lakhs) For Quarter - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 4,465.49, For 30.09.2024 - 3,381.28, For 31.12.23 - Rs. 3,510.09 For Nine months - For 31.12.2024 Rs. 10,212.28, For 31.12.2023- 7,329.93 For Year - For 31.03.2024 - Rs. 10,022.19 c) Profit / Loss before tax : (Rs. in Lakhs) For Quarter - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 4,465.49, For 30.09.2024 - 3,381.28, For 31.12.23 - Rs. 3,510.09 For Nine months - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 10,212.28, For31.12.2023- 7,329.93 For Year - For 31.03.2024 - Rs. 10,022.19 d) Net Profit after Tax : (RS. in Lakhs) For Quarter - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 3,368.22, For 30.09.2024 - 2794.87, For 31.12.23 - Rs. 2707.63 For Nine months - For 31.12.2024 - Rs. 8284.92, For 31.12.2023- 5,870.48 For Year - For 31.03.2024 - Rs.7983.83.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplan